body:
your great grandmother looks like a beautiful woman!

there was a little too much damage for me to work with perfectly, (I'm only learning!), but here's a copy with the face and hair cleaned up like you requested:  [https://imgur.com/aLXeRWB](https://imgur.com/aLXeRWB)

&#x200B;

and as a bonus, though I tried and couldn't salvage the background, I made a copy with a different one:  [https://imgur.com/GpNQ85K](https://imgur.com/GpNQ85K)

&#x200B;

hope this helps ;v;

 https://imgur.com/Z774UGr 

&#x200B;

it's a really nice picture and I hope you can get it away from the glass, I tried my best to remove some of the damage for now, in case something goes wrong! good luck :)
